## CurriedProxy and tools_catalog

At the heart of Cerebrum's tool management system lies the dynamic interplay between CurriedProxy and tools_catalog. This relationship forms the foundation for how Cerebrum understands, manages, and executes its growing collection of capabilities.

The tools_catalog serves as Cerebrum's living memory of tools and capabilities. Like a well-organized library, it maintains a comprehensive catalog of every tool, function, and capability available to the system. Each entry is carefully documented with rich metadata - descriptions, parameters, return types, and usage patterns. This isn't just a static collection; it's a dynamic registry that grows and evolves as new tools are discovered or created.

CurriedProxy acts as the intelligent interface to this tool library. It's the skilled librarian who not only knows where everything is but also understands how to use each tool effectively. When users or the system need to execute a tool, CurriedProxy handles all the complexity of tool resolution, parameter validation, and execution orchestration. It can work with everything from simple Python functions to complex AI tools, OpenAPI integrations, and even other AI frameworks like CrewAI.

What makes this duo special is their ability to adapt and grow. The tools_catalog can dynamically register new tools at runtime, automatically extracting and organizing their metadata. CurriedProxy then makes these tools immediately available for use, handling all the necessary type conversions and execution patterns. This creates a seamless experience where new capabilities can be added and immediately put to use without requiring system restarts or complex integration work.

The system maintains perfect isolation between different specialized states while allowing controlled evolution and modification. Each tool execution is carefully managed to ensure proper context and state handling, preventing any unintended side effects or state pollution. This creates a robust foundation for safe self-modification and capability extension.

Through this architecture, Cerebrum achieves a remarkable balance between flexibility and reliability. New tools can be easily added and integrated, while existing tools remain stable and trustworthy. The system can grow and adapt to new needs while maintaining rock-solid execution guarantees.

